00003},{"ratio":0.92,"watchRatio":0.45345},{"ratio":0.93,"watchRatio":0.4488},{"ratio":0.94,"watchRatio":0.4458},{"ratio":0.95,"watchRatio":0.43979999999999997},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.43235},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.4235},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.4112},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39765},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.39415}],"script":{"source_path":"hxic2Rflp44.en-orig.vtt","words":160,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0.1,"text":"Why is Shri Ram painted inside secular"},{"sec":2.1,"text":"India's Constitution? In the original"},{"sec":3.9,"text":"1950 manuscript, this art sits right at"},{"sec":6.4,"text":"the top of Part III, Fundamental Rights,"},{"sec":8.6,"text":"and the artist Nandalal Bose painted"},{"sec":10.6,"text":"Shri Ram returning victorious from"},{"sec":12.5,"text":"Lanka. But why put him above your"},{"sec":14.1,"text":"rights? Well, for decades the British"},{"sec":16.1,"text":"claimed the Indians were incapable of"},{"sec":18.1,"text":"governing themselves, and that is how"},{"sec":19.8,"text":"they justified ruling us. So when India"},{"sec":22,"text":"finally sat down to write their own"},{"sec":23.7,"text":"Constitution, they put Shri Ram on top"},{"sec":26,"text":"of their rights as an exact answer to"},{"sec":27.8,"text":"British, because Ramarajya meant a ruler"},{"sec":30.7,"text":"was bound by law to protect the weak."},{"sec":33,"text":"And that made justice an Indian idea"},{"sec":35.4,"text":"thousands of years before British"},{"sec":36.8,"text":"arrived. And it doesn't stop with Ram,"},{"sec":38.8,"text":"because if you turn few pages later,"},{"sec":40.7,"text":"Krishna is teaching Arjuna on top of"},{"sec":43.1,"text":"Directive Principles. So what about"},{"sec":45.1,"text":"secular? Well, that word isn't in 1950s"},{"sec":47.7,"text":"Constitution at all. It was added in"},{"sec":49.4,"text":"1976 during emergency."}],"text":""}}